          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 mt-1">
            <li>Accident: T-bone collision in <a href="/california-car-accident-settlement-calculator/" class="text-link hover:underline">California</a></li>
            <li>Diagnosis: Grade III whiplash, C5-C6 disc herniation with left arm radiculopathy, confirmed on MRI</li>
            <li>Treatment: 7 months of PT + chiropractic, 3 epidural steroid injections, neurologist</li>
            <li>Medical bills: $22,400</li>
            <li>Lost wages: $9,600 (8 weeks off work)</li>
            <li>Multiplier: 3.5x (objective disc findings, nerve symptoms, prolonged treatment)</li>
            <li>Pain & suffering: $22,400 × 3.5 = $78,400</li>
            <li><strong>Total claim value: $110,400</strong></li>
            <li class="text-mute">Policy limits: $100,000. Settled at limits: $100,000.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

